# Frontend E2E tests

Playwright specs in `frontend/tests/e2e/` drive two browser contexts against the **real** smoke backend. They are nightly only (`npm run e2e` from `frontend/`, after `node scripts/smoke/up.mjs`).

Do not add mocked UI specs here. Those belong in `frontend/tests/integration/` and run on every PR.

Do not use this folder for routine coverage of a user-visible flow.
